        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "probes because resistance mutations are widespread across the entire   gene with no  pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9645385742188,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "predominant mutations. Instead, the Genoscholar PZA-TB assay targets a 700 base pair (bp)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        524.3084106445312,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "fragment covering the entire   gene and promoter region up to nucleotide –18 of the wild- pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969808578491211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        208.93618774414062,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "type H37Rv reference strain.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.447509765625,
        525.822021484375,
        157.53550720214844
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 2.4.4.1 Nipro GenoScholar PZA-TB II strip (a) and Nipro GenoScholar PZA-TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        158.947509765625,
        167.87290954589844,
        173.03550720214844
      ],
      "text": "II kit contents (b)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.73899841308594,
        435.8905029296875,
        282.7593078613281,
        451.1004943847656
      ],
      "text": "a b",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.2787170410156,
        527.2296752929688,
        481.4237365722656
      ],
      "text": "DNA extracted from cultures is amplified with primers by PCR. Amplified DNA is then hybridized",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.957517623901367,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        483.7787170410156,
        526.9918823242188,
        496.9237365722656
      ],
      "text": "to complementary oligonucleotide probes that are bound on a membrane strip. Streptavidin",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.2787170410156,
        526.6876220703125,
        512.4237060546875
      ],
      "text": "labelled with alkaline phosphatase is then added, to bind to any hybrids formed in the previous",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970561027526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.7786865234375,
        527.0908813476562,
        527.9237060546875
      ],
      "text": "step. Next, a substrate is added, and an enzymatic reaction results in purple bands, which",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.2786865234375,
        526.958984375,
        543.4237060546875
      ],
      "text": "are visually interpreted. The absence of wild-type probe binding indicates the presence of a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.7786865234375,
        526.91162109375,
        558.9237060546875
      ],
      "text": "mutation. The first version of the assay contained 47 probes, which covered the   promoter  pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971814155578613,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        561.2786865234375,
        526.9595947265625,
        574.4237060546875
      ],
      "text": "and open reading frame. The second version contained 48 probes, three of which (  16,  pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.7786865234375,
        526.8074951171875,
        589.9237060546875
      ],
      "text": "17 and 35) represent silent mutations known to be genetic markers not associated with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.2786865234375,
        524.4098510742188,
        605.4237060546875
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide resistance: Gly60Gly (probe 16), Ser65Ser (probe 17) and Thr142Thr (probe 35).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        617.790283203125,
        239.91468811035156,
        634.1702880859375
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.4212036132812,
        526.991943359375,
        657.5662231445312
      ],
      "text": "The Genoscholar PZA-TB LPA assay, which is already commercially available, could potentially",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.9212036132812,
        527.2230834960938,
        673.0662231445312
      ],
      "text": "be implemented for diagnosis of pyrazinamide resistance in routine care. However, limited",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.4212036132812,
        527.0031127929688,
        688.5662231445312
      ],
      "text": "data have been published on the diagnostic accuracy of the assay. This systematic review with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.9212036132812,
        526.9918212890625,
        704.0662231445312
      ],
      "text": "meta-analysis aimed to assist in collating all the available data to understand the diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.4212036132812,
        526.558837890625,
        719.5662231445312
      ],
      "text": "accuracy of the pyrazinamide LPA assay for detection of pyrazinamide resistance in TB patients,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972014427185059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.9212036132812,
        253.38687133789062,
        735.0662231445312
      ],
      "text": "to guide policy-makers and clinicians.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 93",
